# Credentials and local secrets
.env
.env.*
*.env
# ...but keep non-secret env templates tracked (no real values inside)
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.cer
*.crt

# Python/cache/runtime noise
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Local IDE/agent state
.claude/
.codex/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Bank run artifacts and screenshots
**/screenshots/
**/runs/
**/runtime/
**/debug_runs/
**/live_screenshots/
**/page_screenshots/
**/artifacts/
**/logs/
*.log
*.err.log
*.out.log

# Generated transfer payloads and sensitive extracted data
**/bank_form.json
**/balance.json
**/summary.json
**/*_raw.json
**/*_bank_form_test.json
**/latest30_bank_forms_test.json
**/extract_failures.json
# Real OA/M3 extracted payment data and batch payloads (must never be committed)
**/latest.json
**/latest30*.json
**/screenshot_transfer_batch*.json
**/transfer_batch*.json
**/transfer_data.json
# Real bank-portal / transfer screenshots (templates use .example.* names instead)
**/screenshot*.png
**/screenshot*.jpg
# USB-hub controller runtime log (vendor tool writes log.txt next to the exe)
**/log.txt

# USBHub 厂商驱动与控制软件（vendor 二进制，本机已安装，不入库；保留 hub_ctrl.py 入库）
# - CH341 串口驱动安装包：SETUP.EXE / *.sys / *.SYS / *.DLL / *.CAT / *.INF / *.VXD 等
/公共/usbhub/usbhub/CH341SER/
# - "第一步驱动包"：CH341SER.exe 等驱动安装器
/公共/usbhub/usbhub/多口USB控制器软件以及驱动/第一步驱动包/
# - "第二步软件"：usbHubCtrl.exe + Qt*.dll + vc_redist.x64.exe 等厂商控制软件
/公共/usbhub/usbhub/多口USB控制器软件以及驱动/第二步软件/

# Windows and Office temporary files
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
~$*
*.tmp
*.bak
